    "en": "Durga Puja 2027 is 326 days away, and we're already planning 🗺️\n\nSaptami falls on Wednesday 6 October 2027, twelve days earlier than this year. This year the guide had pandal routes, food stops and every theme in one place. For next year we want to build what you actually need.\n\nMore routes? More food? Crowd tips? Your own para on the map? Or something we haven't thought of?\n\nWhat should we build for Pujo 2027 in Kolkata? Tell us in the comments 👇",
